# Ines administers Lumen Studio, where admins approve rules first. Priya, a member on her own
# Mac, moves a rule to the org's store; Ines is asked, keeps it, and it reaches Priya's Mac.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
prefer themeId aura-noir
signed-in
origin https://lumen.invalid/storefront.git
project storefront shop
orgpolicy admins_approve "Lumen Studio"
orgmember priya "Lumen Studio"
orgshare "Lumen Studio"
orgmove here "Run pnpm check before every commit."
host laptop priya
orgmove laptop "Use pnpm, never npm, for every install."
settle 6
chat Wren
settle 2
key cmd-alt-6
settle 4
snap rules-admin-asked
